flowchart LR
DB[(Authoritative DB)] --> H[Versioned Hint]
H --> SUB[Screen Subscription]
SUB --> REC[Reconciliation Controller]
REC --> LOAD[Authorized Reload]
LOAD --> GUARD[Scope / Generation Check]
GUARD -->|Current| UI[Commit UI State]
GUARD -->|Stale| DROP[Discard]
TIMER[Periodic / Resume Fallback] --> REC
